opportunities.description:
Build and run a worldwide promotion stage after Global Opportunity Radar.

Definition of done:
- search fresh open GitHub bounty/reward issues globally;
- inspect authoritative provider evidence in comments (Algora/Opire or documented funded receipt);
- extract reward amount and active attempt count where available;
- reject saturated (>5 active attempts), stale, unsafe, KYC/spend/signature-gated, or unverifiable payout tasks;
- favor $1–$100 bounded Python/JS/TS/Go/docs/data/research tasks;
- maintain target shortlist of 8, max 10;
- do not count shortlist as submission or revenue;
- hand safe candidates to existing execution/Mission Bridge path.
